"FeasycomProfile" = "     Feasycom is a professional and innovative high-tech enterprise equipped with a senior and excellent research and development team, mainly engaged in the design, research and production of short distance communication solutions. Due to our extensive industry experience, our company can provide specialized customized services according to the various needs of our customers. At present, our company has built end-to-end solutions in fields such as the Internet of Things, mobile connectivity, automotive electronics, healthcare, and smart home, and has established close cooperative relationships with numerous domestic and foreign partners. \n\n     The Bluetooth module products of Feiyitong mainly cover Bluetooth versions 4.0, 3.0, 2.1, etc. For different customers and application environments, we have launched Bluetooth 4.0 low-power series modules, Bluetooth 4.0 dual-mode series modules, classic Bluetooth 2.1 series modules, etc., mainly used in Bluetooth data transmission, Bluetooth networking, Bluetooth data transmission+audio and other applications. We can provide customers with customized products and one-stop solutions and services. \n\n     In addition, Feasycom has also launched a complete set of Bluetooth solutions such as Bluetooth barcode guns, Bluetooth gateways, TWS speakers, smart toys, etc., which have been widely used in high-tech enterprises at home and abroad, providing a simpler, more free, and one-stop communication mode for end users.";
